n-names></string-name> <article-title>Carriage by the German cockroach (<italic>Blattella germanica</italic>) of multiple-antibiotic-resistant bacteria that are potentially pathogenic to humans, in hospitals and households in Tripoli, Libya.</article-title><source>Ann Trop Med Parasitol</source> <year>2006</year>;<volume>100</volume>:<fpage>55</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>62</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1179/136485906X78463</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16417714</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R10"><label>10. </label><citation citation-type="web">F&#x000e9;d&#x000e9;ration Suisse des D&#x000e9;sinfestateurs [cited 2007 Nov 7]. Available from <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.fsd-vss.ch">http://www.fsd-vss.ch</ext-link></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>